<!doctype html>
<!--
  Generated by scripts/core/regen-hero.sh from assets/captures/hero.html.tmpl. Do not
  edit this file. Every count below is read from the CLI catalogs at build time
  and the Hero stage fails when the frame falls behind the tree. The rule and
  standard names are sampled from those catalogs too. The skill names are the
  one hand-kept list, and the generator fails on a name that has left the
  catalog rather than dropping it from the column.

  Warm neutrals carry the frame and a single rust accent marks the counts and
  the install command. One accent, never two, because promoting a second and
  third into structural roles is what reads as a generated interface.

  Every color below is a custom property the generator fills from
  `canon design css --no-components`, so the palette arrives the same way the
  counts do and a value moved in src/design/tokens.ts moves this frame.
-->
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" href="{{FAVICON}}" />
    <style>
{{TOKENS}}

      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      body {
        background: transparent;
        padding: 24px;
      }
      .window {
        width: 1200px;
        background: var(--color-background);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 44px 52px 38px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        font-family: 'Noto Sans Mono', 'DejaVu Sans Mono', monospace;
        color: var(--color-text-body);
      }

      .topbar {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        font-size: 15px;
        color: var(--color-text-secondary);
        padding-bottom: 22px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      }
      .topbar .name {
        color: var(--color-text);
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .body {
        flex: 1;
        display: flex;
        gap: 52px;
        padding-top: 40px;
      }

      .pitch {
        width: 400px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }
      h1 {
        font-size: 34px;
        line-height: 1.3;
        color: var(--color-text);
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      }
      .sub {
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.65;
        color: var(--color-text-secondary);
        padding-top: 22px;
      }
      .cmd {
        margin-top: 34px;
        background: var(--color-accent);
        border-radius: 7px;
        padding: 12px 18px;
        font-size: 14.5px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--color-background);
      }
      .cmd .sigil {
        opacity: 0.55;
        padding-right: 9px;
      }
      .needs {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: var(--color-text-secondary);
        padding-top: 13px;
      }

      .cols {
        flex: 1;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        align-items: start;
        gap: 18px;
      }
      .col {
        background: var(--color-surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 16px 16px 14px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
      }
      .col-head {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: baseline;
      }
      .col-dest {
        font-size: 11.5px;
        color: var(--color-text-secondary);
        padding-bottom: 12px;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      }
      .col-name {
        font-size: 12px;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      }
      .col-count {
        font-size: 19px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--color-text);
      }
      .entry {
        font-size: 12.5px;
        line-height: 1.95;
        color: var(--color-text-body);
        white-space: nowrap;
      }
      .more {
        font-size: 12.5px;
        color: var(--color-text-secondary);
        padding-top: 11px;
      }

      .topbar .mark {
        color: var(--color-accent);
        padding-right: 10px;
      }
      .topbar .mark svg {
        width: 15px;
        height: 15px;
        vertical-align: -3px;
      }

      .stats {
        display: flex;
        gap: 34px;
        align-items: baseline;
        padding-top: 26px;
        margin-top: 30px;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
        font-size: 14px;
        color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      }
      .stats b {
        color: var(--color-text);
        font-weight: 700;
        padding-right: 6px;
      }
      .stats .note {
        margin-left: auto;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: var(--color-muted);
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
